    say: 'We built the whole buying journey: sign in, browse, start or join a team, pay, and then the team either succeeds, or expires and everyone is refunded. It runs on three services. We left out multiple regions, real money and email. Moving payments into a service of its own is our planned next step.',
    cues: ['16:17:00 — questions (1 minute). Lim repeats each question in one line and names who answers.'],
